  "prefLabel": "Cub 303.09 Irrigation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cub 303.09 Irrigation. Land supporting irrigated farm land that is used exclusively for sustaining livestock or for in-ground crops shall be eligible for current use assessment under the category in which the land would normally qualify.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Cub 300) #12857-B, eff 8-23-19",
